{"id":"02627be788793195","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-lob.md","title":"Löb’s Theorem for an HBL Predicate","display":"thm-abstract-lob — Löb’s Theorem for an HBL Predicate","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-lob","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-lob"],"display":"thm-abstract-lob — Löb’s Theorem for an HBL Predicate","source":"第 IX 章 p. 110，Theorem 4（PDF 127）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]","[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-lob — Löb’s Theorem for an HBL Predicate"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 110，Theorem 4（PDF 127）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cb62be5b9aab48d1\" href=\"?note=cb62be5b9aab48d1\" title=\"92-df-diagonalizable-system\">92-df-diagonalizable-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66b904dce6adc7c4\" href=\"?note=66b904dce6adc7c4\" title=\"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6\">92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_B\">\\(\\Box_B\\)</span> 如上游定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BY\\to Y\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BY\\to Y\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_BX\\to Y)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_BX\\to Y)\\)</span>。P6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY\">\\(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY\\)</span>；与已知 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BY\\to Y\">\\(\\Box_BY\\to Y\\)</span> 合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX\\to Y\">\\(\\Box_BX\\to Y\\)</span>，再由固定点反向蕴涵推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。P1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX\">\\(\\Box_BX\\)</span>，最后得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>。此证明无需一致性或谓词的标准模型正确性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 110，Theorem 4（PDF 127）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-diagonalizable-system","status":"resolved","id":"cb62be5b9aab48d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","status":"resolved","id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BY\\to Y\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash Y.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\leftrightarrow(\\Box_BX\\to Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BY\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":1204,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]] → [[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]] → [[92-thm-abstract-lob]] → [[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"1f22fd0f606ee7bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以 $\\mathcal S=G$、$B=B_G$ 实例化[[92-thm-abstract-lob]]。其完整证明通过固定点 $X\\leftrightarrow(\\Box X\\to\\varphi)$ 与 P6，而不是只把语义上的可证性内化。原书这一结论本身不需要一致性。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-257","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-lob]]"}],"outgoing":["cb62be5b9aab48d1","66b904dce6adc7c4"]}